Sigma Player brand assets
========================

The launcher icons, wordmark, and TV banner use an original Greek sigma (Σ)
shape and the blue, pink, and orange palette permitted by Silo's brand policy.
They do not incorporate the Silo logo or wordmark. SVG sources are in branding/;
scripts/generate-sigma-branding.py renders the Android copies.

These original Sigma Player assets are licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later,
like the application's source code.

The original Silo project's trademarks remain the property of Silo Media
L.L.C.; see TRADEMARK.md for the upstream policy.
